{"pull": {"id": "number:21730", "number": 21730, "title": "KAFKA-20300: Add broker configs for assignment batching and offload", "state": "closed", "draft": false, "created_at": "2026-03-12T09:31:29Z", "closed_at": "2026-03-13T06:52:39Z", "merged_at": "2026-03-13T06:52:39Z", "user": {"login": "squah-confluent", "id": 163298686, "node_id": "U_kgDOCbu9fg", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/163298686?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/squah-confluent", "html_url": "https://github.com/squah-confluent", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/squah-confluent/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/squah-confluent/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/squah-confluent/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/squah-confluent/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/squah-confluent/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/squah-confluent/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/squah-confluent/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/squah-confluent/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/squah-confluent/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "body": "Add group.{consumer,share,streams}.assignment.interval.ms config options\nto control the delay between assignment calculation. These config\noptions are dynamic at the broker level.\n\nAdd group.{consumer,share,streams}.{min,max}.assignment.interval.ms\nconfig options to limit the\ngroup.{consumer,share,streams}.assignment.interval.ms config values.\n\nAdd group.{consumer,share,streams}.assignor.offload.enable config\noptions to control whether assignment calculation is offloaded to a\ngroup coordinator background thread. These config options are dynamic at\nthe broker level.\n\nReviewers: David Jacot <djacot@confluent.io>\n", "labels": [{"id": 8383